  "description": "Acrylic Procreate Brushes – 40 Realistic Acrylic Painting Brushes\nBring the look and texture of traditional acrylic painting to your iPad with this Acrylic Procreate Brush Set. Create bold, expressive artwork with realistic paint texture, rich color, visible brush strokes, and natural acrylic effects.\nPerfect for florals, botanical illustrations, landscapes, portraits, abstract art, illustrations, lettering, and textured digital paintings.\n✨ What’s Included\n-40 realistic acrylic Procreate brushes\n-2 .procreate files – Acrylic Canvases\n-5 Practice Sketches-  to get you started fast! \n*Bold and expressive brush strokes\n*Textured painting and blending brushes\n*Great for detailed artwork and loose painterly styles\n*Designed for Procreate on iPad\n*BEST RESULTS USING APPLE PENCIL \nWhether you’re creating colorful illustrations or trying to recreate the feel of traditional acrylic paint digitally, this brush set gives your artwork a natural, textured acrylic look.\nPerfect for: Digital artists, illustrators, Procreate artists, surface designers, botanical artists, and anyone who loves traditional acrylic painting.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Acrylic Procreate Brushes – 40 Realistic Acrylic Painting Brushes</p>\n<p>Bring the look and texture of traditional acrylic painting to your iPad with this Acrylic Procreate Brush Set. Create bold, expressive artwork with realistic paint texture, rich color, visible brush strokes, and natural acrylic effects.</p>\n<p>Perfect for florals, botanical illustrations, landscapes, portraits, abstract art, illustrations, lettering, and textured digital paintings.</p>\n<p>✨ What’s Included<br>\n-40 realistic acrylic Procreate brushes<br>\n-2 .procreate files – Acrylic Canvases<br>\n-5 Practice Sketches-  to get you started fast! </p>\n<p>*Bold and expressive brush strokes<br>\n*Textured painting and blending brushes<br>\n*Great for detailed artwork and loose painterly styles<br>\n*Designed for Procreate on iPad<br>\n*BEST RESULTS USING APPLE PENCIL </p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating colorful illustrations or trying to recreate the feel of traditional acrylic paint digitally, this brush set gives your artwork a natural, textured acrylic look.<br>\nPerfect for: Digital artists, illustrators, Procreate artists, surface designers, botanical artists, and anyone who loves traditional acrylic painting.</p>",
